{"source":"BMKG — Peringatan Dini Cuaca (nowcast)","feed":"https://www.bmkg.go.id/alerts/nowcast/id/rss.xml","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T16:57:18.440Z","alerts":[{"id":"2.49.0.1.360.0.2026.10.04.16.72.001","link":"https://www.bmkg.go.id/alerts/nowcast/id/CSG20261004001_alert.xml","event":"Hujan Lebat dan Petir","headline":"Hujan Lebat disertai Petir di Sulawesi Tengah","description":"Hujan lebat disertai petir akan terjadi pada 05 October 2026, 00:20 WITA di sebagian wilayah Sulawesi Tengah, khususnya di SINDUE TOBATA, SINDUE TOMBUSABORA, SIRENJA, TORIBULU.\n Kondisi ini berpotensi menimbulkan dampak berupa jarak pandang berkurang, angin kencang, dan banjir lokal.\n Masyarakat dihimbau untuk tetap waspada, mengurangi aktivitas di luar ruangan, serta mengambil langkah-langkah pencegahan yang diperlukan guna menjaga keselamatan.\n Kondisi diperkirakan dapat berlangsung hingga 05 October 2026, 04:00 WITA.","impact":"jarak pandang berkurang, angin kencang, dan banjir lokal","severity":"Moderate","urgency":"Immediate","certainty":"Observed","sent":1791130020000,"effective":1791130800000,"expires":1791144000000,"infographic":"https://nowcasting.bmkg.go.id/infografis/CSG/2026/10/05/infografis.jpg","province":"Sulawesi Tengah","districts":{"primary":["SINDUE TOBATA","SINDUE TOMBUSABORA","SIRENJA","TORIBULU"],"extended":[]},"polygons":[[[-0.168,119.914],[-0.174,119.924],[-0.212,119.933],[-0.236,119.913],[-0.249,119.917],[-0.259,119.922],[-0.27,119.905],[-0.284,119.91],[-0.288,119.924],[-0.296,119.921],[-0.302,119.927],[-0.314,119.921],[-0.324,119.93],[-0.334,119.93],[-0.356,119.914],[-0.356,119.89],[-0.366,119.866],[-0.36,119.863],[-0.348,119.867],[-0.304,119.845],[-0.316,119.813],[-0.291,119.799],[-0.285,119.777],[-0.264,119.786],[-0.256,119.795],[-0.214,119.805],[-0.195,119.818],[-0.176,119.813],[-0.165,119.801],[-0.155,119.799],[-0.143,119.81],[-0.151,119.824],[-0.171,119.903],[-0.168,119.914]],[[-0.452,119.938],[-0.5,119.934],[-0.514,119.938],[-0.509,119.918],[-0.519,119.893